From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 11:54:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hwcontext_vulkan: pass the image format list to the export
 query

try_export_flags() queries the external memory properties of a frames
context with DRM format modifier tiling using the image creation flags,
which include VK_IMAGE_CREATE_MUTABLE_FORMAT_BIT for sampleable images,
but without the VkImageFormatListCreateInfo the images are created
with. The validation layer reports
VUID-VkPhysicalDeviceImageFormatInfo2-tiling-02313 for such a frames
context.

When the creation chain carries a format list, link a copy of it into
the query, so the query describes the images that will be created. A
mutable-format image with DRM format modifier tiling needs that list at
creation anyway (VUID-VkImageCreateInfo-tiling-02353).

Signed-off-by: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
---
 libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c b/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c
index 90d3d14dbb6ce2fec3fe081e57a884a10f04c0aa..dd2117f8ede8217c8969c3840990f9387e85603d 100644
--- a/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c
+++ b/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c
@@ -2777,6 +2777,10 @@ static void try_export_flags(AVHWFramesContext *hwfc,
     const VkImageDrmFormatModifierListCreateInfoEXT *drm_mod_info =
         ff_vk_find_struct(hwctx->create_pnext,
                           VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_IMAGE_DRM_FORMAT_MODIFIER_LIST_CREATE_INFO_EXT);
+    const VkImageFormatListCreateInfo *fmt_list_info =
+        ff_vk_find_struct(hwctx->create_pnext,
+                          VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_IMAGE_FORMAT_LIST_CREATE_INFO);
+    VkImageFormatListCreateInfo fmt_list;
     int has_mods = hwctx->tiling == VK_IMAGE_TILING_DRM_FORMAT_MODIFIER_EXT && drm_mod_info;
     int nb_mods;
 
@@ -2811,6 +2815,17 @@ static void try_export_flags(AVHWFramesContext *hwfc,
                   (hwctx->img_flags) : (VkImageCreateFlags)(VK_IMAGE_CREATE_ALIAS_BIT),
     };
 
+    /* The query must describe the image as it will be created: a
+     * mutable-format image with DRM format modifier tiling carries the
+     * format list from the creation chain, and so must the query
+     * (VUID-VkPhysicalDeviceImageFormatInfo2-tiling-02313). Copy only the
+     * format list, not the rest of the creation chain. */
+    if (has_mods && fmt_list_info) {
+        fmt_list       = *fmt_list_info;
+        fmt_list.pNext = NULL;
+        phy_dev_mod_info.pNext = &fmt_list;
+    }
+
     nb_mods = has_mods ? drm_mod_info->drmFormatModifierCount : 1;
     for (int i = 0; i < nb_mods; i++) {
         if (has_mods)
